	(text "Notes:\n1) Current limit: RELAY_ILIM_REF ≈ 1.83V across 10Ω, \n   about 183 mA.\n2) RELAY_COMMON is +12V through CR2, boosted to 24V by \n   Q6 for about 9µs each PUNCH_SYNC (U28, with \n   C24 = 0.005µF confirmed).\n3) CR3: marking faded, 1N5363 inferred, clamps at \n   about 55V. \n4) Relay 9 is the sprocket.\n5) R44 and R95 are carbon composition while the other \n   seven sense resistors are metal-oxide film, as built."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
